        "sendTo": "={{ $('📋 CV Application Form').item.json['Email Address'] }}",
        "subject": "Update on Your Application for Employment",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>دعوة للمقابلة الشخصية</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f4f7f6;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            text-align: right;\n        }\n        .email-container {\n            max-width: 600px;\n            margin: 20px auto;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n            border: 1px solid #e1e8ed;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background-color: #0f766e; /* لون زيتي احترافي ومهدئ */\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .header h1 {\n            margin: 0;\n            font-size: 24px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n        .content {\n            padding: 30px 25px;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            color: #333333;\n        }\n        .content p {\n            margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .interview-box {\n            background-color: #f0fdfa;\n            border-right: 4px solid #0f766e;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n        .info-item {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .info-item strong {\n            color: #0f766e;\n        }\n        .btn-container {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin: 25px 0 10px 0;\n        }\n        .btn {\n            background-color: #0f766e;\n            color: #ffffff !important;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            padding: 12px 30px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            display: inline-block;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n        }\n        .footer {\n            background-color: #f4f7f6;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 15px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #777777;\n            border-top: 1px solid #e1e8ed;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"email-container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <h1>دعوة للمقابلة الشخصية</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <p>مرحباً <strong>{{ $('📋 CV Application Form').item.json['Full Name'] }}</strong>،</p>\n            <p>يسعدنا إعلامكِ بأننا قمنا بمراجعة سيرتكِ الذاتية المرفقة لوظيفة <strong>{{ $('📋 CV Application Form').item.json['Position Applied For'] }}</strong>، ونود دعوتكِ لإجراء مقابلة شخصية (عن بُعد) للتعرف عليكِ وعلى مؤهلاتكِ بشكل أفضل.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"interview-box\">\n                <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>التاريخ:</strong>15/6/2026 </div>\n                <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>الوقت:</strong> 14:00</div>\n                <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>نوع المقابلة:</strong> أونلاين (Online Interview)</div>\n            </div>\n            \n       \n\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 25px;\">نتمنى لكِ التوفيق، وننتظر لقاءكِ قريباً.</p>\n            <p>أطيب التحيات،<br><strong>فريق الموارد البشرية والتوظيف</strong></p>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "replyToSenderOnly": false
        }
      },
