ss=\"email-container\">         <div class=\"header\">             <h1>New Interview Scheduled</h1>         </div>                  <div class=\"content\">             <p>Dear <strong>HR Team</strong>,</p>                          <p>We would like to inform you that an interview has been scheduled with the following candidate:</p>                          <div class=\"details-box\">                 <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>Candidate Name:</strong> {{ $('📋 CV Application Form').item.json['Full Name'] }}</div>                 <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>Position:</strong> {{ $('📋 CV Application Form').item.json['Position Applied For'] }}</div>                 <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>Date:</strong> {{ $json.interview_date }}</div>                 <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>Time:</strong> {{ $json.interview_time }}</div>             </div>                          <p>Please proceed accordingly and prepare for the interview session.</p>                          <br>             <p>Best regards,</p>             <p><strong>Recruitment Automation System</strong></p>         </div>                  <div class=\"footer\">             Internal Notification • Generated automatically by n8n.         </div>     </div>  </body> </html>",
