        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html> <html lang=\"en\"> <head>     <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">     <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">     <title>Interview Invitation</title>     <style>         body {             font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;             background-color: #f4f7f6;             margin: 0;             padding: 0;             text-align: left;             color: #333333;         }         .email-container {             max-width: 600px;             margin: 20px auto;             background-color: #ffffff;             border-radius: 8px;             overflow: hidden;             box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);             border: 1px solid #e1e8ed;         }         .header {             background-color: #0f766e; /* لون زيتي احترافي ومناسب للمقابلات */             color: #ffffff;             padding: 30px 20px;             text-align: center;         }         .header h1 {             margin: 0;             font-size: 22px;             font-weight: 600;             letter-spacing: 0.5px;         }         .content {             padding: 30px 25px;             line-height: 1.8;         }         .content p {             margin: 0 0 15px 0;             font-size: 16px;         }         .details-box {             background-color: #f0fdfa;             border-left: 4px solid #0f766e;             padding: 20px;             margin: 20px 0;             border-radius: 4px;         }         .info-item {             margin-bottom: 10px;             font-size: 15px;         }         .info-item strong {             color: #0f766e;             display: inline-block;             width: 180px;         }         .btn-container {             text-align: center;             margin: 25px 0 10px 0;         }         .btn {             background-color: #0f766e;             color: #ffffff !important;             text-decoration: none;             padding: 12px 30px;             border-radius: 5px;             font-size: 15px;             font-weight: bold;             display: inline-block;             box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);         }         .footer {             background-color: #f4f7f6;             text-align: center;             padding: 15px;             font-size: 12px;             color: #777777;             border-top: 1px solid #e1e8ed;         }     </style> </head> <body>      <div class=\"email-container\">         <div class=\"header\">             <h1>Interview Invitation</h1>         </div>                  <div class=\"content\">             <p>Dear <strong>{{ $('📋 CV Application Form').item.json['Full Name'] }}</strong>,</p>                          <p>We are pleased to inform you that an interview has been scheduled for the position you applied for. Please find the schedule details below:</p>                          <div class=\"details-box\">                 <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>Candidate Name:</strong> {{ $('📋 CV Application Form').item.json['Full Name'] }}</div>                 <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>Date:</strong> {{ $json.interview_date }}</div>                 <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>Time:</strong> {{ $json.interview_time }}</div>                 <div class=\"info-item\"><strong>Location / Meeting Link:</strong> Online (Google Meet)</div>             </div>                          <p>Please make sure to be available on time. If you are unable to attend, kindly inform us in advance.</p>                          <div class=\"btn-container\">                 <a href=\"{{ $json.meeting_link }}\" class=\"btn\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Interview</a>             </div>                          <p style=\"margin-top: 25px;\">We look forward to meeting you.</p>             <p>Best regards,</p>             <p><strong>Human Resources Department</strong></p>         </div>                  <div class=\"footer\">             This is an automated invitation from our Recruitment Management System.         </div>     </div>  </body> </html>",
