ontent\">             <p>Dear <strong>{{ $('📋 CV Application Form').item.json['Full Name'] }}</strong>,</p>                          <p>Thank you for your interest in the <strong>{{ $('📋 CV Application Form').item.json['Position Applied For'] }}</strong> position and for taking the time to submit your application.</p>                          <div class=\"status-box\">                 Your job application has been rejected due to conflicting information provided in your submission.             </div>                          <p>Our recruitment team carefully reviews all details to ensure compliance with our hiring standards. Unfortunately, due to the inconsistencies found between the submitted documents, we are unable to move forward with your candidacy at this time.</p>                          <p>We appreciate the effort you put into your application and wish you the very best in your future professional endeavors.</p>                          <br>             <p>Sincerely,</p>             <p><strong>Human Resources Department</strong></p>         </div>                  <div class=\"footer\">             This is an automated notification from our Recruitment Management System. Please do not reply directly to this email.         </div>     </div>  </body> </html>",
